B = [
('HMT Watches','South Asia','1960s-1980s','watches','In the style of HMT Watches, modest, dependable, sentimental mid-century craftsmanship. Small round or softly cushioned forms with thin edges and plain reverse sides, finished in polished steel or gold plating. Surfaces are simple and uncluttered in silver white, cream or sunburst gold, with slim baton marks, thin tapering gilt or steel strokes and a fine ring of tiny ticks. Lettering is neat serif capitals, small and evenly spaced. Details are restrained, in thin black or brown leather and plain steel, with the occasional glimpse of fine gilded workings under clear glass. Quiet, middle-class, gift-like and warmly nostalgic.'),
('Godrej','South Asia','1950s-1970s','furniture','In the style of Godrej, solid, heavy, trustworthy mid-century Indian steel design. Tall rectangular boxy volumes of welded sheet steel with rounded corners, squat secure proportions and a single bold vertical chrome pull. Surfaces are thick baked enamel with a faint orange peel texture in grey green, olive, cream, rust brown, pale blue, dark green or black, with thin gold pinstripes and brass fittings. Round, oversized control details feel reassuringly chunky. Marks are looping cursive signature lettering in white, deep red or purple. Mood is secure, domestic, durable and post-independence.'),
('Rooh Afza','South Asia','1900s-present','drinks','In the style of Rooh Afza, rich, nostalgic, floral and festive South Asian lithographic art. A vivid red field framed by a decorative border of small stylised flowers, with a central cartouche holding swashing Latin and Arabic script lettering in white and yellow. Illustrations of rose bunches, fruits, herbs and leaves are drawn in a fine old printing manner with delicate hatching. Forms are tall, square shouldered and slightly ribbed, filled with deep ruby colour and capped in red or gold. Colours are bright red, gold, deep green and cream, with warm red or pale pink backdrops. Cooling, sweet, perfumed, celebratory and heritage-rich.'),
('Khaadi','South Asia','2000s-present','fashion','In the style of Khaadi, earthy, artisanal, modern-heritage handloom textiles. Loose, easy silhouettes in crisp matte cotton with a visible hand woven grain. Palette is mustard, indigo, rust, olive, ivory and deep red. Patterns are bold block-print-inspired motifs, large paisleys, florals, small repeating geometry and interlocking designs in two or three colours, set along edges and borders. Neat threadwork trims every edge, with small mirrors, tassels and long fringed ends. Spaces and photography feel airy, with warm wood, rolls of fabric and soft beige and white walls. Warm, cheerful and sunlit, as in an open courtyard.'),
('Pakistan International Airlines','South Asia','1960s-2010s','airlines','In the style of Pakistan International Airlines, dignified, proud, warm national identity. Bright white fields above a pale beige base, divided by a dark green band edged in gold, with a large waving green and white flag motif. Names appear in big billboard capitals in dark green, backed by a flowing calligraphic script in gold. Folk art references include blue and white floral tile decoration, fine tilework, bright needlework and bold red geometric woven motifs. Rooms use deep green with gold accents and patterned carpets. Green, white and gold glow against bright blue sky, with a thin red and green line in earlier versions.'),
('Aarong','South Asia','1980s-present','retail','In the style of Aarong, rural, handmade, colourful and lovingly textured craft design. Handwoven cotton, silk and fine muslin in vivid turmeric yellow, red, indigo, leaf green and white, with block-printed borders, tiny woven floral motifs and fine stripes. The signature surface is quilted running-stitch embroidery forming flowers, fish, birds, trees and boats in rows of red, blue and green thread on white or black cloth, with a gentle wavy hand-stitched texture. Natural materials such as terracotta, jute, cane and brass add earthy warmth. Spaces are tall and bright with hanging fabrics, rustic wood and earthy walls. Like a village fair in a tidy modern hall.'),
('Mysore Sandal Soap','South Asia','1960s-present','cosmetics','In the style of Mysore Sandal Soap, a treasured, perfumed, royal heritage gift look. Warm vermilion red, glossy gold and cream with sandy yellows, framed by an ornate border and a central heraldic mythical beast with a big curling mane, raised paws and a crown, drawn in a formal crest manner. Names are set in elegant serif capitals beside small line drawings of sandalwood leaves and flowers. Metallic gold surfaces with red printing, softly rounded rectangular forms and pressed emblems feel like a gift tied with a thin ribbon. Mood is traditional, calm, regal and sweetly fragrant, with glossy gold detail.'),
('Ashok Leyland','South Asia','1960s-1990s','vehicles','In the style of Ashok Leyland, rugged, colourful, overloaded, hand-decorated Indian heavy-duty design. Boxy upright forms with flat vertical faces, plain rectangular fronts with a single horizontal bar, wide round lamps and a high stance. Paint is solid blue, red, yellow or cream, worn and faded, with thick hand painted borders, flower and peacock scenes, bold slogans in painted lettering and chequered stripes. Strings of lucky charms and tassels dangle from edges. Rounded steel or fibreglass surfaces in faded red and cream, with simple metal bars as protection. Gritty, dusty, golden hour mood.'),
('IndiGo','South Asia','2000s-present','airlines','In the style of IndiGo, clean, efficient, youthful and accessible modern identity in deep indigo blue. White grounds with a large indigo area sweeping upward, a lighter sky blue accent stripe and small rounded lowercase lettering in indigo. The mark is built from a cluster of round dots arranged into a simple shape, in white or sky blue over indigo. Dark blue details carry tiny white text. Spaces are bright and simple in blue and white, with navy accents. Printed material uses clear white backgrounds, a rich blue block and playful, crisp sans serif type. Cool, fresh and cheerful.'),
('Kingfisher Beer','South Asia','1980s-present','drinks','In the style of Kingfisher Beer, social, festive, glamorous hot-afternoon design with a bird emblem. Cream or white ground with a bold red band and a gold rim, rounded tops and strong upright serif capitals with a small crown icon. A bird in profile with a bright blue back, orange belly and long dark beak perches or dives above the name, drawn sleek and glossy. Slender brown glass and glossy cream and red surfaces are accented with gold rings. Graphics turn bold red and white for sporting occasions. Warm red, gold, cream and a flash of electric blue, poolside and lively.'),
('Tiger Balm','Southeast Asia','1920s-present','cosmetics','In the style of Tiger Balm, vivid, nostalgic, bold medicinal design. Tiny faceted hexagonal or octagonal forms in bright red or white, tightly wrapped in red or white printed paper, with small steel tins painted red and gold. The hero is a striding side-view big cat with a curved tail, drawn in an orange and black woodcut manner, set beside names in Latin and Chinese characters and tidy lines of tiny print. Vertical panels in red, yellow and green hold an arc of text and a leaping central figure. Cartoon animals, hand lettering and a rich orange, yellow and black palette. Old pharmacy feel, pungent and strong.'),
('Proton','Southeast Asia','1980s-2000s','cars','In the style of Proton, proud, modest, practical, optimistic national design of the 1980s and 1990s. Compact, boxy, upright volumes with flat sides, a straight shoulder line, slim chrome edging, rectangular lamps and plain black panels carrying a small badge. Emblems are a dark blue shield with a yellow crescent and star, or a yellow tiger head in a green roundel. Paint is solid gloss in white, red, silver, dark blue and champagne gold, with black plastic trim and simple slim wheel designs. Sloping lines and low fronts appear on sportier shapes. Plain grey cloth interiors. Sunlit, with palm trees and low brick houses.'),
('Jollibee','Southeast Asia','1980s-present','food','In the style of Jollibee, joyful, loud, sweet, family-friendly fast food branding. A round-bodied cartoon mascot bee with a large head, big white eyes, a wide smile, small antennae, tiny wings, a red jacket and a white hat, and a fat black and yellow striped body in smooth glossy outline. The wordmark is chunky rounded red italic letters with a white outline and thick drop shadow on a bright yellow field. Spaces are red and yellow with big windows, shiny tables, plastic chairs and a play corner. Red paper, white and yellow surfaces repeat the palette. Very warm, cheerful and bright.'),
('Sarao Motors','Southeast Asia','1950s-1970s','vehicles','In the style of Sarao Motors, exuberant, crowded, festive, handmade design. Long boxy hand-beaten metal bodies with a long front volume, open facing benches and a canopy roof. Every surface is covered in loud hand painted patterns such as stripes, checks, flames, flowers and animals, outlined in chrome strips, with abundant chrome decoration, small metal figures, tassels and many mirrors. Bold painted lettering carries slogans and names, with religious pictures set above. Interiors have polished rails, velvet or vinyl upholstery, fringes and mirrors. Saturated colour and heaps of chrome shining in the sun.'),
('Singha','Southeast Asia','1930s-present','drinks','In the style of Singha, sunny, tropical, festive heraldic design. A deep red and gold border frames a central mythical lion in a rearing pose with a curly mane, tufted tail, raised paw and fierce expression, drawn in old engraving style and flanked by ornamental curls, a crown emblem and a royal bird crest. The name sits below in bold upright capitals in gold or white. Surfaces are glossy deep red with gold and white detail and gold foil accents that add a sense of ceremony. Amber brown, brown and cream complete the palette. Chilled condensation, spicy grilled food and beach light. Lively and bold.'),
('Garuda Indonesia','Southeast Asia','1980s-2000s','airlines','In the style of Garuda Indonesia, gracious, calm, tropical, island-like identity in deep blue and aqua. Clean white grounds with a swooping blue and turquoise stripe sweeping into solid royal blue, carrying a stylised bird emblem made from five bent lines like a spreading wing in aqua and white. The name is clean blue capitals in a wide, evenly spaced sans serif. An earlier scheme is red and white with a bright orange stripe and a triangular bird. Soft blue upholstery, batik patterns in brown and indigo, wood panels and gentle warm light. Fitted batik with a flower in the hair.'),
('Indomie','Southeast Asia','2000s-present','food','In the style of Indomie, hot, spicy, glossy, hungry, everyday and exuberant design. Flat glossy surfaces in a bright red, orange and yellow gradient with white and gold sparkle, dominated by a big appetising photograph of stir fried noodles topped with a fried egg, shredded meat, cucumber, tomato and crisp shallots, with a drizzle of dark sweet sauce on a plain plate. The name is thick, rounded red and white lettering with a heavy black outline and a small flame or chilli. Variant colours such as blue, green and black code the flavours. Silver foil highlights. Street stall steam and boiling pots.'),
('Thai Airways','Southeast Asia','1990s-2010s','airlines','In the style of Thai Airways, graceful, silky, ornate and festive identity in orchid purple and gold. White grounds with a sweeping band in shades of magenta, violet and gold, merging into a curved mark of a tall stylised flame-like roof curve built from gold and magenta. The name is a softly rounded italic sans serif in purple. Spaces use purple and orange, silk-like fabrics in orchid pink, patterned carpets and orchids as accents. Silk wrap shapes in orchid purple, gold or magenta with a small flower corsage and a neat bun. Rich violet, magenta and gold, with classical dancers and royal barges for special occasions.'),
('Tiger Beer','Southeast Asia','1930s-present','drinks','In the style of Tiger Beer, cool, bold, energetic, nocturnal and urban design in navy, gold and hot orange. A deep navy field with a bold arched gold border, a leaping big cat in orange gold stripes on black rendered in dynamic ink lines, set above the name in big upright yellow capitals. A small crown, malt ears and a ribbon give a heraldic effect. Glossy navy surfaces with gold highlights and metallic silver. Street art, bright orange, black and blue paint splashes, and stylised stripes across city scenes. Ice buckets and red plastic tables at a night food market.'),
('Philippine Airlines','Southeast Asia','1990s-present','airlines','In the style of Philippine Airlines, bright, hospitable, tropical, crisp and patriotic identity built from sail-like triangles. Clean white grounds with the name in italic blue capitals, and a device of one blue triangle and one red triangle pointing like sails, with a small eight rayed yellow sun over the blue. A thin red and blue stripe adds rhythm. Anniversary treatments use large stylised numbers. Spaces use deep blue with red piping and woven patterns, soft light and warm timber. Modern dresses in blue or red with traditional sleeves. Blue, red, white and sunny yellow.'),
('Pasabahce','Middle East','1960s-present','glassware','In the style of Pasabahce, hospitable, bright, tidy, sparkling domestic glass with an Ottoman flavour. Small, slim, waisted forms with a flared lip and a gently pinched middle, clear and thin. Larger pieces have cut and pressed patterns such as diamond facets, rosettes, fine vertical flutes and rows of tiny dots, with domed tops and tall necks. Coloured glass in cobalt blue, emerald green, amber and ruby red carries gilded rims and enamelled floral motifs of tulips, carnations and cypress in gold and white. Heavy rounded bases anchor the forms. Glassy reflections, warm light, patterned cloth and brass in the background.'),
('Iran Khodro','Middle East','1970s-1990s','cars','In the style of Iran Khodro, humble, durable, nostalgic, lived-in practical mid-century design. Plain upright boxy bodies with flat tops, small rectangular fronts with a single horizontal bar, round or square chrome rimmed lamps and thin chrome edging. Paint is thick solid enamel in cream white, sky blue, pale yellow, red, green or bright orange, slightly faded, with black rubber seals and simple steel wheels. Interiors are flat and plain in beige or brown with vinyl seats and a slim steering rim. Seen in rows in dusty light below mountains. Communal and unfussy.'),
('Qatar Airways','Middle East','2000s-present','airlines','In the style of Qatar Airways, luxurious, formal, quiet, upmarket identity in burgundy and grey. Pale grey and white grounds with the name in large burgundy capitals, Arabic lettering nearby in a smaller darker grey, and deep burgundy areas carrying a pale grey ring with a horned antelope silhouette. The finish is smooth and polished, with burgundy accents and a thin fine line. Interiors are stately in grey and burgundy leather with soft lighting. Marble floors, a huge sculpture and leather sofas. Deep maroon tailoring with a neat hat, veil and gold pin. Deep maroon, warm grey and a gleam of metal.'),
('Etihad Airways','Middle East','2010s-present','airlines','In the style of Etihad Airways, opulent, desert-warm, polished and glittering identity in sand and gold. A warm pale beige ground, almost desert sand, with a triangular tessellation in gold and silver facets like a faceted gem, fading toward one side. The name is a golden calligraphic mark. Interiors are sumptuous with beige and brown leather, gold trim and wood veneer. Fitted dark sand-coloured tailoring with a flowing scarf. Pale marble, golden light and sweeping curved roofs. A limited palette of gold, sand, taupe and white.'),
('El Al','Middle East','1970s-present','airlines','In the style of El Al, crisp, clean, secure, patriotic and cool identity in blue and white. White grounds with a sweeping blue line outlined in silver, curving and fading along the form, with plain white or blue areas and a flag. The name is a bold blue wordmark in Latin and a second script. An older scheme uses turquoise topped with a six pointed star and a turquoise and navy line. Interiors use blue with white accents, slim wood-look trim and blue and white carpets. Smart navy tailoring with pale blue shirts. Sunlit blue sky.'),
('SodaStream','Middle East','2010s-present','appliances','In the style of SodaStream, clean, modern, eco-minded, fresh and friendly home design. Slim upright columns in black, white or brushed steel, with plain rounded tops, a single clear push control and a flat base. Clear or tinted tall forms with slim necks carry a fine level line and a single coloured accent such as red, blue, green or bright orange. Slender gunmetal grey or lime green steel adds a small collar. Newer pared back forms in matte steel have a single dial. Flat labels in juicy colours. Imagery shows rising bubbles, fruit slices, ice and a bright white counter.'),
('Ararat Brandy','Middle East','1900s-present','drinks','In the style of Ararat Brandy, deep, aged, ceremonial and warm amber heritage design. Heavy glass with round shoulders and a long neck, closed with dark cork or a gilded stopper, filled with deep amber liquid. Cream or ivory paper with a gold embossed border, a tall mountain with a snowy twin peak, strong serif capitals, an age numeral in a gold seal and a small vignette of a stone building. A red phoenix emblem appears on newer versions. Rows of little gold stars signal quality. Rich wood or velvet-lined cases with metal clasps. Rich brown, gold, burgundy and cream.'),
('Air Astana','Russia and Eastern Europe','2000s-present','airlines','In the style of Air Astana, orderly, formal, cool steppe-wide identity of dark blue and gold. White grounds with a deep navy base, rich blue areas carrying a golden stylised ornament like a pair of wings or a nomadic motif, and gold lettering in a clean wide sans serif. Special treatments stretch a grey-spotted wild cat across the surface with white and blue snowy rock. Navy seating patterned with ornamental motifs in gold thread, grey carpets and warm wood trim. Smart navy with gold buttons and silk in a traditional pattern. A navy field with a thin gold ornamental border, with carved screens and rugs echoing it.'),
('Margilan Yodgorlik Silk Factory','Russia and Eastern Europe','traditional to present','textiles','In the style of Margilan Yodgorlik Silk Factory, vivid, sumptuous, handmade silky resist-dyed textiles. Lustrous silk is patterned by tying and dyeing the threads before weaving, so every motif has softly blurred, feathered edges. Designs are bold and flowing, with large almond shapes, teardrop and flame forms, pomegranates, jagged blossoms, stripes and zigzag bands in saturated jewel colours of ruby red, magenta, saffron yellow, indigo, emerald green and black, outlined by thin white lines on a deep ground. Some cloth is shiny and light, some blends silk and cotton for a matte feel. Natural dyes make colours glow but sit a little uneven.'),
('Rishtan Ceramics','Russia and Eastern Europe','traditional to present','ceramics','In the style of Rishtan Ceramics, warm, rustic, sunlit, homely hand thrown pottery in turquoise and blue. Simple, generous rounded forms with wide shallow curves. The surface has a milky white slip under a clear glaze giving a soft sheen and a faint pale turquoise glow, then painted freehand in turquoise, dark cobalt blue and chocolate brown. Patterns include flowers, branches, pomegranates and pitchers with swirling leafy borders and a central rosette, tiny dotted lines and fine hatching. Some have one calm motif such as a bird or sprig in the middle. Slightly uneven painted lines give life.'),
('Kenya Airways','Africa','2000s-present','airlines','In the style of Kenya Airways, warm, hospitable, proud, bright and savannah-like identity in red, white and black. White grounds with the name in black italic capitals and bright red areas carrying a stylised letter inside a circle, in white and black. Older schemes run four bands of red, green, black and white in the national flag colours. Interiors use red and charcoal with white accents, grey carpets and woven motifs. Red uniforms with black and white scarves and neat caps. Red against clear blue sky.'),
('Castle Lager','Africa','1950s-present','drinks','In the style of Castle Lager, sociable, relaxed, sunny, outdoorsy heraldic design. Brown glass with a cream, gold and green emblem bearing a fortress of crenellated towers and a flag inside an oval seal above the name in strong capitals. Glossy green or silver surfaces carry the castle device and a strip of gold. Imagery features open fires, sports fields, jazz clubs, street scenes and dusty plains, with a creamy head of foam. Bright yellow plastic with black and red marks. Amber, green, gold and cream.'),
('Da Gama Textiles Three Cats','Africa','19th century to present','textiles','In the style of Da Gama Textiles Three Cats, traditional, cheerful, communal, crisp and deeply colourful printed cotton. A stiff starched cloth with a papery finish, printed with all-over repeating patterns that look like intricate engraving. The classic colour is indigo blue with white discharged motifs, alongside chocolate brown, deep red, plum, teal and mustard. Motifs are small geometric diamonds, squares, circles, stripes, flowers, paisleys and tiny dotted trellis designs, finely detailed and very regular. The reverse is a flat solid colour. Full A-line shapes, panels sewn side by side and braid and ribbon edging. The cloth holds sharp creases and shows a faint white chalky bloom along folds.'),
('Basotho Blankets','Africa','late 19th century to present','textiles','In the style of Basotho Blankets, proud, heritage-rich, mountain-chilled wrap design. Heavy, tightly woven wool with a soft nap, rectangular, with fringed ends and a plain edge. Patterns are bold and geometric, with wide stripes, large diamonds, squares, stylised leaf shapes, flowers and crowned shields. Classic combinations include cream and mustard with dark stripes, burgundy and navy blocks, a bold gold and black chevron, and a crown pattern in blue, red and cream. Colours are strong and earthy, with ochre, maroon, navy blue, forest green, black and cream. Draped and pinned at the shoulder, against rocky highlands in cool light.'),
('Ardmore Ceramic Art','Africa','1990s-present','ceramics','In the style of Ardmore Ceramic Art, witty, lush, whimsical, tropical and highly decorative hand sculpted ceramics. Exuberant, playful forms covered with sculpted wild animals such as big cats, striped grazers, monkeys, snakes and birds that climb, perch and curl around the shapes. Surfaces are a dense riot of dots, lines and leafy patterns in bright glossy colours, including cobalt, emerald, orange, purple, turquoise, red and gold, with iridescent scales and shimmering lustres. Flowers and vines twist across surfaces in fine relief. Edges are outlined in dark. Every piece looks like a miniature jungle, bursting with colour and detail.'),
('Kazuri','Africa','1970s-present','jewellery','In the style of Kazuri, joyful, earthy, handmade, colourful and sunny glazed clay design. Hand rolled and shaped pieces, slightly unique and irregular, in round balls, discs, short tubes, cones, ovals, chunky cylinders and tiny seeds, with smooth glass-like surfaces. Colours include cobalt blue, cherry red, mustard yellow, forest green, turquoise, terracotta orange, black, white and speckled earthy brown. Some are hand-painted with swirls, dots, stripes and zigzags in contrasting glaze. They are grouped chunky and mixed in many colours, in long ropes and multiple strands. Matching speckled glaze appears on simple rounded forms.'),
('EgyptAir','Africa','1970s-2000s','airlines','In the style of EgyptAir, stately, ancient, desert-sunny and glowing identity of lapis blue, gold and red. White grounds with a deep blue and gold area carrying a golden falcon figure in a flowing wing-spread pose with a red head, blue feathers and a gold backdrop. The name appears in Latin and Arabic script in dark blue. An older scheme has a warm band of red, gold and orange swirling like a sunset glow. Interiors use blue and gold with geometric motifs, pale wood trim and a gold emblem. Smart navy with gold accents.'),
('Ethiopian Airlines','Africa','1990s-present','airlines','In the style of Ethiopian Airlines, welcoming, proud, highland-bright and colourful identity. Pale grey and white grounds with a flowing band of green, yellow and red lines sweeping upward. A deep green area carries a yellow and red stylised bird or wing emblem. The name is shown in a native script and Latin capitals in dark green. Interiors feature green with woven patterned cloth in red and gold, white accents and wood panels. Green, yellow and red with white woven cotton trimmed in coloured borders. The three colour bands repeat as flowing ribbons. Green, gold and red against clear blue sky.'),
('Royal Air Maroc','Africa','1990s-present','airlines','In the style of Royal Air Maroc, warm, hospitable, ornate and sunny identity of red and green geometry. White grounds with a vivid red area carrying a green five pointed star inside a round white emblem, and a slim green and red stripe. The name appears in Latin and Arabic script in bold dark red. Interiors use deep red and green fabrics, tile-inspired geometric patterns in white and blue and brass accents. Smart dark red with a fine scarf and decorative pin. Blue skies over terracotta walls, tilework in blue, green and white and palm trees. Carved latticework repeats an eight pointed star.'),
('Tusker Lager','Africa','1920s-present','drinks','In the style of Tusker Lager, communal, sunny, savannah, relaxed and proud design in red, gold, black and cream. A cream and red field with an upright elephant head in profile with long curved tusks, drawn in bold black ink, above the name in strong capitals. Gold foil accents repeat with red, gold and black and the same emblem. Walls are decorated with big hand painted logos and slogans in bold yellow and red sign-painter lettering. Friends around wooden tables beneath thatch with grilled meat, on dusty roadsides. Bold black emblems on bright red.'),
('Sapporo Brewery','East Asia','1970s-present','drinks','In the style of Sapporo Brewery, crisp, masculine, social, evening-lit and no-nonsense design with a star emblem. Tall slim forms in matte black with a bold gold star and name, or silver with a red star in a circle, or cream and gold with thin ruled borders, and deep green with gold edging for special editions. The star is drawn in a crisp geometric outline, centred, with a wordmark in strong serif or slab capitals. Silver foil highlights. Golden liquid with a thick white foam head. A small pub with grilled skewers and paper lanterns. Black, gold, red and silver.'),
('Los Castillo','Latin America','1950s-60s','silver','In the style of Los Castillo, mid-century Mexican modernist metalwork. Heavy hand-hammered forms with sculptural animal shapes like long-necked birds, seahorses, pelicans and fish whose bodies swell into smooth rounded volumes. Surfaces are bright polished metal with a warm slightly rippled hammered texture, set off by chunky cabochon inlays of deep green banded stone, blue lapis and azurite pressed flush into the metal. Silver married with copper and brass forms interlocking geometry, stepped-fret and feathered-serpent motifs abstracted into bold simple shapes with strong negative space. Festive, organic and luxurious, with a slightly imperfect handmade finish and visible tool marks.'),
('Dona Rosa Barro Negro','Latin America','1950s-present','ceramics','In the style of Dona Rosa Barro Negro, hand-built forms with a deep, mirror-like metallic black sheen. Clay is shaped by hand with no wheel, so forms are softly rounded and slightly asymmetrical, with tall proportions, round bellies, narrow necks and playful figure shapes. The surface is rubbed with a smooth stone before firing in smoke, giving a silky gunmetal-to-jet shine with soft grey matte patches where the burnish is lighter. Decoration is restrained, with applied clay flowers, rosettes, twisted ropes, delicate pierced lacework openwork and fine incised lines. Earthy, sculptural and quietly elegant, an ancient shape language with a polished modern gleam, on plain pale backgrounds.'),
('Jacobo y Maria Angeles Workshop','Latin America','1990s-present','folk art','In the style of Jacobo y Maria Angeles Workshop, joyful, hallucinatory, highly saturated carved and painted folk art. Light soft wood is hand-carved into lively mythical creatures, often with a human face or braided hair on an animal body, caught mid-action while flying, scratching or leaping. After a smooth base coat, the whole body is covered in intricate fine-line ornament in vivid colours of magenta, turquoise, saffron yellow, orange, leaf green and black, in dense repeating patterns of dots, scrolls, flowers, plants, stepped geometric motifs and ancient temple-wall designs. Eyes are large and glossy. Light satin finish, with every surface patterned and nothing left blank.'),
('Tenango Otomi Embroidery','Latin America','1960s-present','textiles','In the style of Tenango Otomi Embroidery, folk, cheerful, playful and slightly naive fantastical animal and plant scenes stitched on cloth. A plain white or cream base, sometimes black, red or blue, filled edge to edge with flat, outlined figures. Motifs are large stylised birds, deer, rabbits, horses, lizards, butterflies and fish, mixed with lush curling flowers, leaves, trees and tiny dots, arranged symmetrically or in mirrored pairs around a central tree. Colours are saturated and not realistic, with sunny yellow, grass green, cobalt blue, hot pink, orange, red and purple. Dense, tight stitching with thick coloured thread gives a slightly raised, filled-in look with bold dark outlines.'),
('Wixarika Huichol Beadwork','Latin America','1960s-present','folk art','In the style of Wixarika Huichol Beadwork, ceremonial imagery rendered in dense blazing colour. Tiny glass beads are pressed one by one into a layer of wax and resin over carved forms, leaving a shining mosaic surface with a slightly bumpy glittering texture. Flat areas use thick coloured wool pressed into wax in tight spiralling lines that follow each shape like contour maps. Motifs are deer, maize, cactus, scorpions, five-petalled flowers, sun faces, rain clouds and diamond-backed snake bodies, with zigzag lines radiating outward. The palette is neon-bright and contrasting, fuchsia, turquoise, lime green, electric blue, orange, yellow, red and black with white outlines, filled completely so no background shows. Psychedelic, symmetrical and intricate.'),
('Granado Pharmacias','Latin America','1870s-present','cosmetics','In the style of Granado Pharmacias, nostalgic, refined, slightly aristocratic nineteenth-century apothecary design. Simple old-fashioned materials such as glass, cork, frosted surfaces, tin and plain paper. Cream, white, pale pink or soft green grounds with a thin double-line border, centred oval cartouches, fine ornamental scrollwork and curling flourishes, with elegant serif and decorative Victorian display lettering in deep burgundy, bottle green, navy or gold. Tiny repeating floral and botanical prints and sometimes a small crowned crest. Dark polished wood, glass-fronted shelves, marble and tiled floors in black and white or terracotta. Muted pastel and old-gold accents with restrained, tidy typography.'),
('Varig','Latin America','1960s-90s','airlines','In the style of Varig, clean, optimistic, glamorous jet-age design. Polished bare-metal surfaces beneath white, separated by a thin navy-blue line, with the name in large dark blue capitals in a clean wide sans-serif. A vivid royal or cobalt blue field carries a large circular compass rose emblem in white and gold with dark rays around a central disc. A later scheme becomes a gold-yellow rose on deep blue. Earlier versions show a winged figure in a black circle and a bold black stripe. A thin italic script word as a small accent. Lots of reflective silver metal.'),
('Wayuu Taya','Latin America','1990s-present','bags','In the style of Wayuu Taya, handmade, tropical, energetic and slightly raw design. Soft round-bottomed cylinder forms crocheted in a tight single-strand spiral so the fabric is dense and slightly stiff, with a flat circular base and a flat wide strap. A band in one solid colour contrasts with a body covered in large bold geometric designs. Patterns are repeating diamonds, zigzags, stepped squares, crosses, labyrinth-like meanders and stripes in thick yarn. The palette is joyful and high-contrast, hot pink, turquoise, lemon yellow, orange, red, royal blue and lime green against black, white or cream, often with a gradient or striped panel. Braided cords with large tassels, twisted rope, pompoms and visibly wavy lines and woollen texture.'),
('Centro de Textiles Tradicionales del Cusco','Latin America','1990s-present','textiles','In the style of Centro de Textiles Tradicionales del Cusco, rich, rustic, rhythmic and symmetrical hand-woven textiles in natural dyed wool. Long narrow bands and square cloths in slightly fuzzy hand-spun yarn. The tight weave shows crisp horizontal stripes of plain colour alternating with dense patterned bands of diamonds, zigzag lines, small stepped figures, birds, animals, flowers inside diamonds, meandering lines and tiny geometric motifs, reversible on both sides. Colours are earthy plant-dye shades, deep indigo and sky blues, cochineal reds, pinks and purples, yellow-greens, mustard, walnut brown, cream and charcoal. Edges are finished with braided cords and tassels. A precise ancient textile language in warm natural tones.'),
('Chulucanas Ceramics','Latin America','1980s-present','ceramics','In the style of Chulucanas Ceramics, minimalist, tactile, graphic and folk-modern ceramics with smoky resist decoration. Smooth rounded thin-walled forms with softly bulging bodies, narrow necks and plump shapes, polished to a glossy sheen. Decoration comes from painting liquid clay slip over areas that stay light, then smoke blackens the bare areas, giving crisp contrasts of cream, orange-tan, chocolate brown and glossy black. Patterns are polka-dot spots, tight rows of dots, checkerboards, stripes, spirals, wavy lines, stepped angles and little fish or leaf motifs, often in two colours only, black on tan or tan on black. Like contemporary sculpture from an ancient workshop.'),
('Habanos Cohiba','Latin America','1960s-present','cigars','In the style of Habanos Cohiba, severe, luxurious, quiet, exclusive and masculine design. Narrow black bands with bold yellow-gold geometric lettering in angular, jagged capitals inspired by a carved ancestral mask, with a yellow and black chequered pattern inside the main letters. Smaller white and gold secondary bands sit beside it. Flat black or dark brown surfaces with rich lacquer, clean edges, gold foil embossing and matte black panels. Smooth, shiny, dark oily brown surfaces with fine veins, thin cedar wood, in a deep red and brown glow. A restrained palette of black, yellow, dark green and cedar.'),
('Havana Club','Latin America','1930s-present','spirits','In the style of Havana Club, warm, rhythmic, nostalgic and tropical old-city street-art flavour. Tall squared-shoulder clear glass with a sturdy cork, filled with amber or golden liquid. Cream or ivory paper with an aged, slightly weathered look, a big ornate nineteenth-century cartouche with a gold and red border, a small oval vignette of a fortress and a colonial tower, and lettering in tall wood-type capitals and rounded script. Contemporary versions add colourful screen-printed illustration in saturated flat inks of red, blue, yellow and green, with musicians, dancers, palm trees, vintage cars and skyline. Metallic foil and ribbed stamping in silver and gold. Faded colonial palette of mint green, terracotta, sun yellow, turquoise and sepia.'),
('ICAIC Cuban Film Posters','Latin America','1960s-70s','graphic design','In the style of ICAIC Cuban Film Posters, vibrant, witty, politically charged and strongly handmade silkscreen design. A few flat, saturated colours in layers with no gradients, bright red, yellow, cobalt blue, orange, green, pink and black, laid down one screen at a time on cheap rough paper with slightly uneven edges and visible misregistration. Imagery is bold, simplified and symbolic, such as a giant eye, a cut-out head, a hand, a skeleton, a face split into colour planes or a single object enlarged to fill the sheet, with playful surreal collage-like juxtapositions and sharp cut-out edges. Lettering is hand-drawn, chunky, irregular, sometimes stencil-like. Pop art, psychedelia and constructivism blended with satire.'),
('Havanna Alfajores','Latin America','1940s-present','confectionery','In the style of Havanna Alfajores, friendly, sweet, nostalgic seaside design in a trustworthy clean cream and blue palette. Deep turquoise-blue or royal blue and white schemes with warm cream, a large rounded white script logo like a flowing signature over navy, slim gold or silver details and a small orange rising-sun mark. Soft rounded rectangular shapes, shiny foil, tin and maritime references such as a seaside town and small gulls. Round, glossy dark chocolate or white icing over soft pale layers. Warm wood-and-brass spaces, with dark wood, tall windows, beige marble and lamps with amber light.'),
('Pomaire Potters','Latin America','19th century-present','ceramics','In the style of Pomaire Potters, earthy, handmade, humble and warm rustic terracotta. Heavy, thick-walled forms, unglazed or lightly burnished, in warm reddish-brown to dark grey-brown clay with a smooth matte surface that darkens with use. Shapes are chunky and round, with two ear handles, wide shallow curves and plump volumes. Plump little animal figures and small pinched and moulded folk figures add charm. Some are painted with simple flat colours or white slip dots and stripes, others left plain with finger marks and uneven rims. Kiln smoke gives mottled black clouds and variations. Rough wooden shelves in an adobe market.'),
('Guna Mola Cooperatives','Latin America','20th century-present','textiles','In the style of Guna Mola Cooperatives, graphic, rhythmic, vibrant and strongly handmade design. Two to seven layers of thin cotton in contrasting solid colours, the top layer cut away in curving shapes so the layers beneath peek through, with edges turned under and hemmed with tiny nearly invisible stitches. The design fills the whole panel with energetic horror vacui of tightly packed shapes in parallel concentric outlines, like a thick-lined labyrinth, depicting birds, fish, sea turtles, flowers, masks and abstract geometry. Colours are bright, fully saturated and placed in bold contrast, red against orange, black against yellow, green against hot pink, blue against white. Flat and symmetrical like stained glass.'),
('Bacardi','Latin America','1860s-present','spirits','In the style of Bacardi, festive, tropical, confident and slightly retro heraldic design. The central symbol is a black bat with outspread wings seen from the front, drawn in a bold, simple, slightly gothic silhouette with a small head, set inside a red, white and black field. Bright, clean white or cream with a red, black or gold border, big black block lettering, a small crest and a tiny red wax-like seal. Premium versions use deeper amber, gold-foil edging and aged cream with ornate serif lettering. Dark oak and iron hoops appear in the background. Sunny beaches, palm fronds and bright red umbrellas. Art Deco geometry in blue-and-white tiles with stepped crowns.'),
('Haitian Metal Drum Art','Latin America','20th century-present','folk art','In the style of Haitian Metal Drum Art, raw, intricate, spiritual and richly patterned flat sculpture cut from recycled steel. Panels are flattened, drawn with chalk, then chiselled and punched so the line work appears as cut-through openings and raised ridges. Subjects are a tree of life, mermaids, birds, fish, sun faces, spirits with elaborate headdresses and crosses, drawn with symmetrical swirling leaves, scales, dotted outlines, hearts and curling vines. The metal is left dark grey and rust-brown, sometimes polished to rough silver with burn marks, or hand-painted in bright enamel like red, yellow and turquoise. Shapes are oval, round or irregular with ragged cut edges. A rugged industrial material turned into delicate lace.'),
('Acoma Pueblo Pottery','North America','20th century-present','ceramics','In the style of Acoma Pueblo Pottery, crisp, disciplined, optical and graceful extremely thin-walled hand-coiled ceramics with fine-line painting. Rounded forms with high shoulders and small openings, and low wide shapes, with a very fine white slip surface that is smooth, matte and chalk-like. The walls are paper thin. Decoration is painted with a fine brush in black and rusty orange or red-brown on the creamy white ground, in dense precise geometric bands. Motifs are fine-line lattices and hatching, interlocking triangles, birds, rainbows, stepped clouds, animals with a heart line and scrolls, with bands wrapping horizontally and tidy empty zones at the base. Unglazed, powdery. Like delicate op-art on earthenware.'),
('San Ildefonso Pueblo Pottery','North America','1920s-present','ceramics','In the style of San Ildefonso Pueblo Pottery, sleek, dark, formal, sculptural and timeless. Hand-coiled, perfectly symmetrical forms with a rounded, full body, a marked shoulder angle, a short narrow neck and a slightly flattened rim. The whole surface is burnished to a glass-smooth gloss and smoke-fired to a deep jet black. Designs are painted in clay slip which stays matte after polishing, so the pattern shows as flat dull black against a shining black field, visible only as light shifts across it. A wide band holds a coiled horned water serpent, rain clouds, steps, lightning zigzags, mountains and bird tracks. Perfect balance.'),
('Toadlena Trading Post Weavings','North America','1900s-1930s','textiles','In the style of Toadlena Trading Post Weavings, calm, earthy, refined and architectural natural-wool tapestry. Flat-woven very tightly and finely in a rectangular format with a dense, almost smooth surface. Colours come only from undyed wool carded and blended, so the palette is creamy white, light and dark grey, tan, camel, chocolate brown and jet black, with no bright dye. The design is a symmetrical central geometric field with diamonds, stepped zigzags, concentric rectangles and terraced crosses, framed by a plain border and a crisp inner outline, with small tapering corner details. Balanced, precise and optical, with crisp straight edges. Like a desert landscape abstracted into straight lines.'),
('West Baffin Eskimo Cooperative','North America','1950s-present','graphic design','In the style of West Baffin Eskimo Cooperative, quiet, northern, graphic and dignified design with a simple, bold and direct line. Simple powerful animals and spirit figures with big expressive eyes and feathers drawn as repeating curved shapes, printed in flat ink on thin pale cream or white handmade paper. The ink is deep black, with blue-grey, ochre, red-orange, green and teal appearing as flat blocks, with a soft grain from the stone and a subtle ridge around each shape, often with generous empty space around them. Sculpture is smooth, rounded, polished dark green-grey or black stone in heavy, compact forms of animals, figures and hybrid creatures.'),
]
